# Baghewala CSS-SRP Digital Twin

A digital twin for heavy-oil cyclic steam stimulation (CSS) and sucker rod pump (SRP) coupled simulation and optimization.

## Getting Started

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
make install
```

## Running Tests

```bash
make test
```
